# A2A seats

Prefer MCP `a2a_list_seats` and `a2a_send` (or `scripts/a2a/send.sh`) for Director-to-Director **new work** pings. Do not use send.sh / a2a_send to ack the caller of an A2A wakeup — print RESULT; duplex notifies. The local hub is protocol-ack: `TASK_STATE_COMPLETED` / A2A ACK is a receipt, not mind-turn done. Mail is consumed only after grok/cursor runner exit 0. Never fake ACP HANDOFF. Dispatch wakes leftover seats. Never print hub secrets or ACP tokens.
